<tr><td>True lilies (<em>Lilium</em>) and daylilies (<em>Hemerocallis</em>)</td><td>Extremely dangerous</td><td>Minor stomach upset at most</td><td>Kidney failure in cats, even from a small amount</td></tr>
<tr><td>American mistletoe</td><td>Toxic</td><td>Toxic</td><td>Vomiting, diarrhoea; rarely low blood pressure, breathing trouble or a slow heart rate</td></tr>
